      <title>The record-breaking, genre-melting, career-redefining evolution of Miranda Lambert</title>
      <author>Jewly Hight</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/03/nx-s1-5943132/miranda-lambert-crisco-choosin-texas-interview</link>
