      <title>Just short of its 200th birthday, a landmark natural history museum shuts down</title>
      <author>Andrew Stelzer</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/03/nx-s1-5989716/philadelphia-academy-natural-sciences-museum-closure</link>
