f8cd3fad42f587b0aa1606a05c1b%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2213.jpg" class="img" alt="Pickard China factory is full of hulking, noisy, clay-splattered machines. The company’s team of gilders mixes the chemical in with the pigments they use to handpaint plates, cups and other high-end porcelain homewares." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Pickard China's David Nosko stand by one of the factory's hulking, noisy, clay-splattered machines.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Akilah Townsend for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;div id="resg-s1-145540" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4500;         --source-height: 3375;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7d%2Fdd%2Fea70201c4c90979b1876b1d50dc7%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2266-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Scenes within the Prickard China factory in Antioch, IL" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Pickard's clients include the White House, U.S. embassies, fancy hotels, private jets, golf clubs, and higher-end retailers like Williams-Sonoma.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Akilah Townsend for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;But despite its prestigious clientele, the company and the fine china industry as a whole have been facing a long decline. Pickard's sprawling factory is in urgent need of repairs and upgrades, and its current output is roughly a quarter of what it was at the company's peak in the 1970s.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"There's a kind of cultural cliff that things have fallen off in terms of this sort of commodity," said &lt;a href="https://history.camden.rutgers.edu/about/faculty/philip-scranton/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Philip Scranton&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, an emeritus historian of American industrial development at Rutgers University. Scranton said escalating manufacturing costs and the spread of casual lifestyles since the 1970s caused nearly all of the American china factories to go bust or move operations overseas. "And I am not sure whether there's a way of recovering that market."&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;aside id="mid-story-recommendations-mount-piano" class="mid-story-recommendations-mount-piano" aria-label="recommended stories"&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;    &lt;!-- END ID="MID-STORY-RECOMMENDATIONS-MOUNT-PIANO" CLASS="MID-STORY-RECOMMENDATIONS-MOUNT-PIANO" ARIA-LABEL="RECOMMENDED STORIES" --&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Scranton put Pickard's survival down to "stubbornness and legacy." &lt;a href="https://www.pickardchina.com/pages/pickard-china-130-years-of-rich-history?srsltid=AU7gw4Us6e47OAqnOnk8eNgpdGUr337R8ZJzxg42a93cYGLsNcPmQo95" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Launched&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in 1893 by pottery salesman Wilder Pickard, it was run by the Pickard family throughout its history. And then &lt;a href="https://www.theastergates.com/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Theaster Gates&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; showed up.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Art world titan &lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145514" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4500;         --source-height: 3375;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brights