026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F22%2F21%2Fd8582b3b45f09a252caedac40c6e%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2199-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Theaster Gates first got in touch with Pickard through Illinois first lady MK Pritzker, who he counts as a friend, along with other high-powered figures including the Obamas." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Theaster Gates first got in touch with Pickard through Illinois First Lady MK Pritzker. He counts her as a friend, along with other high-powered figures, including the Obamas.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Akilah Townsend for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;"The idea that Pickard could be a place bringing artisanal manufacturing back to the fore – that's very exciting," Gates said on a visit to the Pickard factory in early September, his seventh or eighth in recent months.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;On this particular day, Gates and Andy Pickard Morgan, the fourth-generation family member in charge of the company since 2006, had just informed Pickard's 12 full-time staff members of the artist's acquisition of the business for an undisclosed sum.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"I'm still digesting everything," said David Nosko, a member of Pickard's pottery operations team, not long after hearing the news. "We've seen Theaster come through a few times and I always liked his energy."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Gates, though soft-spoken and bespectacled, is a contemporary art world titan whose name often shows up on the industry's most influential &lt;a href="https://artreview.com/power-100/?year=2021" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;lists&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. His installations, made out of salvaged materials, sell for hundreds of thousands of dollars and appear in &lt;a href="https://www.theastergates.com/about" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;major museums&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Gates has a &lt;a href="http://partnership" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;long-term partnership&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; with Prada, creating exhibitions and serving on the brand's diversity council. And he moves in high-powered circles, counting The Obamas and Illinois first lady MK Pritzker among his friends.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145515" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4500;         --source-height: 3375;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F76%2Fb8%2Fce47292a4aee8777230a7f2bea97%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2170-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F76%2Fb8%2Fce47292a4aee8777230a7f2bea97%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2170-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F76%2Fb8%2Fce47292a4aee8777230a7f2bea97%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2170-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F76%2Fb8%2Fce47292a4aee8777230a7f2bea97%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2170-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F76%2Fb8%2Fce47292a4aee8777230a7f2bea97%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2170-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F76%2Fb8%2Fce47292a4aee8777230a7f2bea97%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2170-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x337