b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;When Gates needed a manufacturer for a homewares project he was working on with Prada earlier this year, it was Pritzker who put Gates in touch with Pickard. "I said, 'Well, Pickard — it's got to be Pickard,' " Pritzker said. " 'It's the only one made in America. Let me just hook you guys up.' "&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;The conversation quickly evolved when Pickard Morgan told Gates he was within a few years of retiring, and no one in the Pickard family wanted to take on overseeing the factory's rapidly aging infrastructure and managing a highly-skilled workforce who would find it difficult to secure another job in their field. So he asked the artist if he'd be interested in buying the business.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;"What meant the most to me was finding someone like Theaster," Pickard Morgan said. "And not some turnaround company that was going to come in and lay people off and try to sell Pickard a year and a half later for a profit." (Pickard's main competitor, Lenox, was &lt;a href="https://www.centrelanepartners.com/2020/10/20/lenox-corporation-americas-leading-tabletop-giftware-and-home-entertaining-company-acquired-by-an-affiliate-of-centre-lane-partners/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;sold&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to a private investment firm in 2020 and &lt;a href="https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/lenox-corporation-announces-closure-of-kinston-nc-factory-301043260.html" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;moved production&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to Asia and Europe.)&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;An unlikely, yet canny match&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145532" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4500;         --source-height: 3600;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3600+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F05%2F20%2F2530d7404e5f9f1481895606c0cd%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1885-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Ken Mehta, the owner of a neighborhood hardware store on Chicago&amp;#039;s south side, which Gates purchased in 2014 when Mehta was looking to retire." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Ken Mehta, the former owner of a neighborhood hardware store on Chicago's South Side. Gates purchased the store in 2014 when Mehta was looking to retire.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Akilah Townsend for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;The match between a hip contemporary artist and an old-fashioned porcelain business might seem strange. But the 53-year-old Gates's vision of what an artist is and does is expansive.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"I'm interested in the most outer limits of what we might consider art," he said.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Gates himself is a master ceramicist who focuses on Japanese and African-American traditions and has worked to highlight little-known Black potters. He recently mounted a &lt;a href="https://gagosian.com/exhibitions/2026/theaster-gates-dave-all-my-relations/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;show&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; at the prestigious Gagosian Gallery in New York about the 19th century enslaved ceramicist David Drake.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Also relevant is Gates' long track record of restoring and repurposing defunct buildings, archives and businesses, mainly on Chicago's South Side.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"If I just sold it to someone, they could have just run it down," said Ken Mehta, the former owner of a neighborhood hardware store which Gates' purchased in 2014 when Mehta was looking to retire. The artist then &lt;a href="https://www.theastergates.com/news/theaster-gates-ascends-art-history-returns-home-transporting-us-back-to-life-within-things-at-the-hardware-store" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;transformed&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; the space and its massive inventory into an art installation and events space. "Theaster, he put his heart in it, and that brings a lot of value to the neighborhood."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145534" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4500;         --source-height: 3375;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2F09%2F9be13ea542359b5f12ddb1f9a0e4%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf1970-2.jpg" class="img" alt="After purchasing Mehta&amp;#039;s hardware store, Gates transformed the space and its massive inventory into an art installation and events space." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 After purchasing Mehta's hardware store, Gates transformed the space and its massive inventory into an art installation and events space.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Akilah Townsend for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Gates also created a cultural center out of the renovated premises of a condemned bank building, which he bought from the City of Chicago for $1 in 2013. The &lt;a href="https://stonyislandartsbank.com/about" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Stony Island Arts Bank&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; now holds thousands of books relating to Black history and culture from Johnson Publishing, the company behind the trailblazing Black lifestyle magazines &lt;em&gt;Ebony&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Jet&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"He's someone who has a deep and profound respect for building upon legacy and preserving legacy," Linda Johnson Rice, Johnson Publishing's chairman and CEO.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;Johnson Rice said that's why the artist's purchase of Pickard China makes sense. But she also said breathing new creative life into dormant commercial assets is not the same thing as running an existing company.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145537" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4500;         --source-height: 3375;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x3375+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ff4%2F3b%2Fc9e0a9ce458eb4ecdf6ee7710c86%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2085-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Linda Johnson Rice, of the Johnson Publishing Company, poses for portrait within the Johnson Library Archive at the Stony Island Arts Bank in Chicago, Ill." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Linda Johnson Rice, of the Johnson Publishing Company, poses for portrait within the Johnson Library Archive at the Stony Island Arts Bank in Chicago, Ill. Gates purchased the building in 2013, rescuing it from demolition and transforming it into a cultural center on the city's South Side.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Akilah Townsend for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;"These businesses and archives are, for lack of a better word, static. And this business that he's just acquired is an ongoing business," Johnson Rice said. "Welcome to the real world of business, Theaster!"&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;A daunting assignment&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;p&gt;The new president of Pickard China certainly has a lot to contend with.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Gates said the factory needs a new roof and HVAC system, among other urgent repairs. His priorities include building a team to manage the daily operations, while he guides the company's creative strategy. Pickard Morgan said he plans to stay on in an executive role.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145528" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 3375;         --source-height: 4500;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3375x4500+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F4f%2F54%2F570b0daf4e94b8cacdce93dabf19%2F2026-09-theastergates-atownsend-dsf2297-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Theaster Gates poses for a portrait at the Pickard Factory office in Antioch, Ill." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Theaster Gates poses for a portrait at the Pickard Factory office in Antioch, Ill.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Akilah Townsend for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Gates said he's not fazed by the magnitude of the task ahead.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"All of the parts that would scare you – like, it's a big building, it's 60,000 square feet, a staff that I would inherit – for some reason, all of those things become a little bit poetic," Gates said. "Not only do I get to add to the legacy, it's giving me new ideas for what the future of my artistic practice will be."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;This includes expanding his work in ceramics to include porcelain. After all, he did just buy a china factory.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Jennifer Vanasco edited the audio and digital versions of this story, with an assist from Clare Lombard. Chloee Weiner mixed the audio. Danielle Scruggs is the photo editor.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
