      <title>Brazil's big political rematch: What to know about the Brazilian election</title>
      <author>Catherine Osborn</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/02/nx-s1-5989727/brazil-election-lula-bolsonaro-flavio-democracy</link>
